ng: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">lift and support&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">a child&rsquo;s legs at hip level, making it less top-heavy while<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;r</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">educing stress on the body</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 17px; font-family: 'DIN Next', sans-serif; color: rgb(80, 72, 73); margin: 0px; line-height: inherit; text-align: inherit; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 17px; font-family: 'DIN Next', sans-serif; color: rgb(80, 72, 73); margin: 0px; line-height: inherit; text-align: inherit; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">✅ MAXIMUM COMFORT:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">A s</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">turdy, reinforced X-back strap</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;evenly distributes a child&rsquo;s weight</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;throughout the back, shoulders, hips and legs. Honeyroo&reg; is carefully crafted to utilize the strongest parts of the back while&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">unlocking more areas of the body to assist in weight bearing.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 17px; font-family: 'DIN Next', sans-